# Hyperfocus Zone

> **Dream it. Build it. Feel it. Ship it.**

Hyperfocus Zone is an immortal, AI-powered ecosystem built with the **Hyperfocus Vibe Coding Protocol**. This repo contains bots, agents, a web portal, automation, experiments, and assets (including the Hyperfocus Vibe Coding infographic) so ideas can be prototyped fast and hardened to run forever.

