## Quick start (dev)

1. Copy environment example and fill local values:

   ```bash
   cp .env.example .env
   # edit .env with your local values
   ```
2. Boot everything locally (docker-compose dev):

   ```bash
   make dev
   # or
   docker-compose up --build
   ```
3. Open the web portal: `http://localhost:3000`

