## CI / CD (must-haves)

* Central `.github/workflows/ci.yml` that runs tests only for changed packages.
* Dependency & container scanning (Trivy, Snyk, or GitHub native alerts).
* Automatic staging deploys for `develop`/`staging`; production on tagged releases `v*`.

---

## Secrets & envs

* Use Vault / AWS/GCP secret managers.
* `.env` files are local only and must be in `.gitignore`.
* `infra/secrets/README.md` should document how to fetch and rotate keys.

