## ADHD / Hyperfocus friendly tips

* Keep an `experiments/` folder for messy vibe-code. Promote winners to `services/` with a short migration checklist.
* Add `NEXT_ACTIONS.md` to each service with 3 bullet items (helps reduce friction and decision paralysis).
* Use commit hooks or CI to remind you to add a short PR description and tags.

